;; WASI preview 1 (wasi_snapshot_preview1; doc/wasm/WAI.md §6): the functions Go's wasip1 port imports (runtime, syscall,
;; internal/syscall/unix: 36 names) and the rest of the snapshot's as ENOSYS, over a sandboxed directory tree. The guest sees its
;; preopened directories by their guest names; a path is resolved component by component inside its preopen (`..` never above it,
;; a symbolic link followed inside it, an absolute link target refused: ENOTCAPABLE), so the guest reaches nothing else of the
;; host's file system. Written after the snapshot's witx (WebAssembly/WASI, legacy/preview1) as Go's syscall/fs_wasip1.go reads it;
;; wazero's imports/wasi_snapshot_preview1 (v1.12.0) read as a reference for the layouts, nothing of it converted.


